 "titulo": "He turned a whole royal court into stone 🐍 Perseus Part 3 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "THE KING TURNS TO STONE",
 "descripcion": "Invisible, with Medusa's head in a bag, Perseus fights a sea monster for a chained princess and comes home to the king who sent him to die.\n\nWould you have opened the bag?\n\nFrom Greek myth: Apollodorus, Library 2.4; Ovid, Metamorphoses 4-5; Hesiod, Theogony.\n#perseus #medusa #greekmythology #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Invisible under the helmet of Hades, Perseus *escaped* the screaming Gorgons.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Flying home, he saw a woman chained to a rock above the sea.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Princess Andromeda. Her mother had bragged she was prettier than the sea nymphs.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So the gods sent a *sea monster* to eat her.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Perseus dived from the sky with his blade.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He struck the monster again and again, until the water turned dark.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Andromeda was free. But Perseus still had a promise to keep.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the king on Seriphos thought he was dead.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Polydectes was feasting, and still forcing his mother to marry him.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Perseus walked into the hall. The guests laughed.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So, where is my gift? Where is the head of the Gorgon?",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Perseus told his mother to close her eyes.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then he lifted the head out of the bag.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The king, the guards, every guest who laughed, turned to *stone*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He gave the head to Athena, who put it on her shield forever.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Years later, at a sports contest, Perseus threw a *discus*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The wind took it into the crowd, and struck an old man dead.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "His grandfather. The prophecy came true, just like the oracle said.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
